<title>USA: Coca-Cola FEMSA sets $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola FEMSA sets $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Coca-Cola FEMSA was priced on Monday, according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities</p>
<p>BORROWER COCA-COLA FEMSA</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	COUPON 8.95 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	  ISS PRICE 99.961  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA2    YIELD 8.956 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS  SPREAD +240 BP    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
